  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.2: Two asciidoctor-parity table-parser fixes. List items containing `|` inside an `a|` AsciiDoc-content cell no longer drop the entire `<li>`; the pre-pipe portion stays in the cell's list and the post-pipe portion is consumed as a new cell at the table-grammar level, matching the reference engine. A leading blank line between `|===` and the first row no longer triggers spurious implicit-header detection — an implicit header exists only when the first content row is immediately followed by a blank line. See CHANGELOG.md.",
